ai "Power Back"
about "Downhill. Hits the hole, lowers the shoulder, falls forward."
position RB
dials vision 0.45 patience 0.35 aggression 0.85 discipline 0.6

rules:
  when with the ball and enemy within 1.6 -> lower shoulder; protect the ball
  when with the ball and blocker ahead -> follow my blocker
  when with the ball -> cut upfield
  when before the throw and assignment is block -> pick up the blitz
  otherwise -> follow assignment
